{
  "_comment": "Vegeta's own specials, by hand; npm run rom -- states --fighter vegeta merges them into states.json (src/rom/specials.ts). big_bang is move ad, the Big Bang shot upward (owner, 2026-10-31): on the ground, 10 health, its parts mad / mad_2 / mad_3. The flash at the hands (vegeta_flash, mad_2's first frame) is not put out yet. final_flash is move ac (docs/rom.md, Final Flash): 10 health, A held charges \u2014 let go before frame 20 the small beam, before 32 the medium, else the large (field f0, $20:9A82); the ball grows 2 a frame from 16 at 24, -46. mac_2 fires head, base and band (size 16 / 12 / 8, never thicker); then move b5 holds the pose, the band still drawn, until the head is gone and 24 / 20 / 16 frames more (jumps to 72 / 76 / 80 of 96). As for Goku's Kamehameha, the charge fires as it decides (the original shows 2 more frames, a jump to frame 42) and the head outlives its thrower's move. sliding_kick is move a4, Sliding Kick, ↓ ↘ → B on the ground; typed again from frame 8 to its end, it is kept and a5 (rushing_knee) follows when a4 is over, and the same from a5 (from frame 1) to a6 (cross_punch, cross_punch_2) \u2014 field f0, $20:97c7 / $20:9885. Nothing else is read meanwhile; a miss goes on too.",
